{"task_id":"VG-01","route":"GRAPH_ASSISTED_POINTER_READS","answer":"/graph-find is the public command for finding source-verified repository pointers. The bounded ingestion scan covered 180 files and 1,176,198 source bytes; unsupported files are skipped, explicit include paths are indexed, and structural gaps are reported. The graph remains in memory and returns pointer evidence rather than complete source bodies. Its JSON result includes ranked hits, evidence paths and byte ranges, excerpt/source hashes, facet coverage, scan status, route, reason, and source snapshot hash. This run returned route=graph because reason=verified_tag_context_selected, with 81.51% facet coverage, no unresolved obligations, and fail_closed=false. It refuses graph sufficiency when the supported scan is incomplete: scan_complete=false, route=defer, and repository_scan_incomplete are reported. If no usable source remains, the command fails. Defer preserves source authority; ranking is diagnostic, not authority or answer-confidence proof.","citations":[{"source_path":"plugins/graph-engineering/skills/graph-find/SKILL.md","byte_start":1440,"byte_end":1518,"excerpt_sha256":"e8d0077b765d739aa8fbe885a29c044cdfee77eae671df3c186939c46014688a","excerpt":"`repository_scan_incomplete`. The command fails when no usable source remains.","source_sha256":"dc75ea7e534d5f2b72f5ac18e9e098b40d28eb0ced6569eb08e1070c2b086c58"},{"source_path":"plugins/graph-engineering/skills/graph-find/SKILL.md","byte_start":1383,"byte_end":1439,"excerpt_sha256":"b45c0e527cd98eab5a144aec9ec72de68ac83524c5c53481a1de00bf578d77a7","excerpt":"`scan_complete: false`, uses `route: defer`, and reports","source_sha256":"dc75ea7e534d5f2b72f5ac18e9e098b40d28eb0ced6569eb08e1070c2b086c58"},{"source_path":"plugins/graph-engineering/skills/graph-find/SKILL.md","byte_start":209,"byte_end":221,"excerpt_sha256":"6dfade4c2e6bb305e3e9a8d47964d691b631ccacdf7203ffde5ee8a286a635ef","excerpt":"# Graph Find","source_sha256":"dc75ea7e534d5f2b72f5ac18e